      inverterNote: "Since around 2019, most residential Daikin units sold in Malaysia (iSmile, SMILE Series) run on R32 inverter compressors, which adjust speed to match cooling demand and use roughly 30–40% less electricity than older fixed-speed Daikin models still running R410A or R22. If your Daikin unit is more than 8 years old, it is very likely non-inverter — KL Renovator services both types, but inverter compressor boards require more careful capacitor and PCB diagnosis, which our technicians are trained for.",
      inverterNoteMS: "Sejak sekitar 2019, kebanyakan unit Daikin kediaman yang dijual di Malaysia (iSmile, SMILE Series) menggunakan kompresor inverter R32, yang melaraskan kelajuan mengikut permintaan penyejukan dan menggunakan kira-kira 30–40% kurang elektrik berbanding model Daikin non-inverter lama yang masih menggunakan R410A atau R22. Jika unit Daikin anda lebih 8 tahun, ia berkemungkinan besar non-inverter — KL Renovator menservis kedua-dua jenis.",
      inverterNoteZH: "自2019年左右起，马来西亚销售的大多数大金住宅机型（iSmile、SMILE系列）均采用R32变频压缩机，可根据制冷需求调节速度，比仍使用R410A或R22的旧款定频大金机型省电约30–40%。如果您的大金机器已使用超过8年，很可能是定频机——KL Renovator两种机型均可提供服务，但变频压缩机板需要更仔细的电容器和PCB诊断，我们的技术员均受过相关训练。",
