      inverterNote: "York's residential YHJF and YHAF ranges sold in Malaysia are mostly non-inverter (fixed-speed compressor), while the commercial York Affinity range includes both inverter and non-inverter variants depending on capacity. Non-inverter York units are generally simpler to diagnose (fewer PCB fault points) but use more electricity — R22 gas top-up is still available for legacy non-inverter York units, but we always recommend a leak check first since R22 systems lose gas gradually rather than failing outright.",
      inverterNoteMS: "Julat kediaman York YHJF dan YHAF yang dijual di Malaysia kebanyakannya non-inverter (kompresor kelajuan tetap), manakala julat komersial York Affinity termasuk kedua-dua varian inverter dan non-inverter bergantung kepada kapasiti.",
      inverterNoteZH: "马来西亚销售的York住宅YHJF和YHAF系列大多为定频机型（固定速度压缩机），而商用York Affinity系列则根据容量包含变频和定频两种型号。定频York机型通常更容易诊断（PCB故障点较少）但耗电更多——旧款定频York机型仍可提供R22充气服务，但我们始终建议先进行检漏，因为R22系统会逐渐漏气而非突然失效。",
