      inverterNote: "Carrier sells both inverter and non-inverter models in Malaysia. The Xpression residential series launched around 2018 as Carrier's main inverter range (R32), while the older 38M/42Q series still in many landed houses and shophouses are non-inverter R22 or R410A units. Carrier inverter units use a 5mm copper stub for service ports that requires the correct torque wrench during connection — over-tightening cracks the valve and causes a slow leak that often only shows up 6 months after service. Our technicians use a calibrated torque wrench on every Carrier service port connection.",
      inverterNoteMS: "Carrier menjual kedua-dua model inverter dan non-inverter di Malaysia. Siri kediaman Xpression dilancar sekitar 2018 sebagai julat inverter utama Carrier (R32), manakala siri lama 38M/42Q yang masih terdapat di banyak rumah teres dan kedai adalah unit non-inverter R22 atau R410A. Juruteknik kami menggunakan torkrench yang ditentukur pada setiap sambungan port servis Carrier.",
      inverterNoteZH: "Carrier 在马来西亚销售变频和定频两种机型。Xpression 住宅系列于 2018 年左右推出，作为 Carrier 的主要变频系列（R32），而许多排屋和店屋中仍在使用的旧款 38M/42Q 系列则为 R22 或 R410A 定频机。Carrier 变频机型使用 5mm 铜制维修接口，连接时需要正确的扭力扳手——拧得太紧会损坏阀门并导致缓慢泄漏，通常在保养后 6 个月才显现。我们的技术员在每次 Carrier 维修接口连接时都使用已校准的扭力扳手。",
