      metaTitleMS: "Servis Aircond National KL & Selangor | KL Renovator",
      metaDescMS: "Servis aircond National pakar di KL & Selangor. Cuci kimia, tambah gas, pembaikan & penyelenggaraan. Hubungi +60182983573.",
      metaTitleZH: "吉隆坡及雪兰莪National冷气服务 | KL Renovator",
      metaDescZH: "吉隆坡及雪兰莪专业National冷气服务。化学清洗、充气、维修和保养。致电 +60182983573。",
      description: "KL Renovator services all legacy National air conditioner models across KL and Selangor. Our experienced technicians provide careful chemical wash, gas top-up (R22), wiring repairs and spare part sourcing for older wall-mounted and window units.",
      descriptionMS: "KL Renovator menservis semua model penghawa dingin National lama di KL dan Selangor. Juruteknik kami menyediakan cuci kimia yang teliti dan tambah gas R22.",
      descriptionZH: "KL Renovator在吉隆坡和雪兰莪为所有传统National空调型号提供服务。我们经验丰富的技师为老式壁挂机和窗机提供化学清洗和充气服务。",
      highlights: ["Legacy National aircond servicing", "R22 refrigerant gas top-up", "Careful chemical cleaning", "Capacitor & fan motor repair", "Same-day service available", "Experienced HVAC technicians"],
      models: ["National CS/CU Series", "National Eolia Series", "National Window Units"],
